#upgrade-complete-modal-dialog.ui.modal
  .ui.card
    h2.card-header
      | Thanks for upgrading!
    .card-body
      | Yay you did it!
    .card-footer
      .right
        button.ui.btn click='closeUpgradeModal target="view"'
          if App.containers.length
            | Go to my container
          else
            | Close
